{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17117","headline":"圆灵水镜 · 张聿","name":"圆灵水镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤池开月镜，清莹写寥天。\n影散微波上，光含片玉悬。\n菱花凝泛灧，桂树暎清鲜。\n乐广披云日，山涛卷雾年。\n濯缨何处去，鉴物自堪妍。\n回首看云液，蟾蜍势正圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张聿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}